This purpose of this project is to create a packaged python tool which makes working with nhs rtt waiting list data straightforward.

The code should be structured into three main areas

1. A data retrieval component which leverages the scrapy package to retrieve raw data
2. An extract, transform and load of the data sources into a sqlite database using pandas and sqlalchemy
3. A simple data querying and reporting feature to expose the data to high level queries suitable for python notebooks and pandas

this project is using

* a uv virtual environment.
* modern python 3.11 and above

We are not looking to be backward compatible with earlier versions of python,
or support previous styles of data retrieval.
